# C6 / A7 — Code owners. Replace the placeholder accounts before use.
# Owners must approve pull requests that touch their paths when the ruleset
# requires code-owner review (.github/ruleset.json). The last matching line wins.

*                               @change-reviewer

# Governance rules, checks and their configuration
/governance/                    @governance-owner
/policy-config/                 @governance-owner
/scripts/                       @governance-owner
/.github/                       @governance-owner

# Agent instructions and permission profiles (A7)
/AGENTS.md                      @governance-owner
/CLAUDE.md                      @governance-owner
/.claude/                       @governance-owner
/.vscode/                       @governance-owner
/agent/                         @governance-owner

# Dependency manifests need a licence and vulnerability decision (C5)
**/requirements*.txt            @governance-owner
**/pyproject.toml               @governance-owner
**/package.json                 @governance-owner
**/*.csproj                     @governance-owner
